d </span><span begin="00:28.950" end="00:29.040">we </span><span begin="00:29.040" end="00:29.310">fight</span><span begin="00:29.310" end="00:29.310">, </span><span begin="00:29.310" end="00:29.430">then </span><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.520">you </span><span begin="00:29.520" end="00:29.730">call </span><span begin="00:29.730" end="00:29.850">me </span><span begin="00:29.850" end="00:29.910">a </span><span begin="00:29.910" end="00:31.740">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.980" end="00:35.640"><span begin="00:31.980" end="00:32.130">I </span><span begin="00:32.130" end="00:32.460">walk </span><span begin="00:32.460" end="00:32.520">out </span><span begin="00:32.520" end="00:32.610">the </span><span begin="00:32.610" end="00:32.850">door</span><span begin="00:32.850" end="00:32.850">, </span><span begin="00:32.850" end="00:32.940">but </span><span begin="00:32.940" end="00:33.060">you </span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:33.240">won't </span><span begin="00:33.240" end="00:33.420">let </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:33.480">me </span><span begin="00:33.480" end="00:33.720">let </span><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:35.610">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.640" end="00:38.970"><span begin="00:35.640" end="00:35.940">Turn </span><span begin="00:35.940" end="00:36.120">right </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.390">around</span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:36.390">, </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:36.630">throw </span><span begin="00:36.630" end="00:36.930">rocks </span><span begin="00:36.930" end="00:36.990">at </span><span begin="00:36.990" end="00:37.080">your </span><span begin="00:37.080" end="00:38.820">window</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.970" end="00:42.810"><span begin="00:38.970" end="00:39.390">But </span><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:39.570">I </span><span begin="00:39.570" end="00:39.900">can't </span><span begin="00:39.900" end="00:40.710">forget </span><span begin="00:40.710" end="00